    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_220_grani#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#5"
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   So, this really is the only entrance to the cave, huh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "So, this really is the only entrance to the cave, huh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Mhm. It's like a maze inside the cave, but the village elders have brought me here several times before, including when I succeeded the previous chief...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Mhm. It's like a maze inside the cave, but the village elders have brought me here several times before, including when I succeeded the previous chief..."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   ...Um, I might just be imagining things, but don't you think the shouts from inside the forest are getting louder...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "...Um, I might just be imagining things, but don't you think the shouts from inside the forest are getting louder...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Things are only going to get worse if we run into any more delays.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Things are only going to get worse if we run into any more delays."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Carol, you know your way around inside the cave, right? I'd like you to go inside and retrieve the treasure right now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Carol, you know your way around inside the cave, right? I'd like you to go inside and retrieve the treasure right now."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Huh? What about you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Huh? What about you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   I'll stay at the entrance.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "I'll stay at the entrance."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   No way!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "No way!"
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Huh? Carol...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Huh? Carol..."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   You're going to face the bounty hunters alone? That's too dangerous! You'll be...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "You're going to face the bounty hunters alone? That's too dangerous! You'll be..."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   If I can't help you secure that treasure, I'd be letting down the entire village, and you as well.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "If I can't help you secure that treasure, I'd be letting down the entire village, and you as well."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   ...But, I don't want to lose you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "...But, I don't want to lose you."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   This... isn't the time or place for you to be playing hero...!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "This... isn't the time or place for you to be playing hero...!"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   What's wrong with playing the hero?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "What's wrong with playing the hero?"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   'Even with their hearts impaled by the enemy's blades, the King's knights still held on to their spears.'",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "'Even with their hearts impaled by the enemy's blades, the King's knights still held on to their spears.'"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   I refuse to run away.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "I refuse to run away."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Grani...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Grani..."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Besides, Carol, this isn't just my battle.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Besides, Carol, this isn't just my battle."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   It's also your battle. Perhaps you will run into dangers along the way, but as long as we can restore peace to this land...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "It's also your battle. Perhaps you will run into dangers along the way, but as long as we can restore peace to this land..."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   We must face our duties head-on.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "We must face our duties head-on."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   I trust that you'll find the treasure.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "I trust that you'll find the treasure."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   But... if I'm alone...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "But... if I'm alone..."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   The treasure...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "The treasure..."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Trust me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Trust me."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   No matter what, I'll protect you. Back when I rescued you, I promised that nobody would ever hurt you again.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "No matter what, I'll protect you. Back when I rescued you, I promised that nobody would ever hurt you again."
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   Not even a single strand of hair on your head.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "Not even a single strand of hair on your head."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Even though you're just a kid...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Even though you're just a kid..."
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"Grani\"]   I'm no such thing... I'm just vertically challenged!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Grani",
        "content": "I'm no such thing... I'm just vertically challenged!"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_003\",name2=\"char_220_grani#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_003",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   Haha!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "Haha!"
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Carol\"]   ...Mm, I'll do as you said, Grani.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Carol",
        "content": "...Mm, I'll do as you said, Grani."
    },
